                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a17c1a1-e228-49cd-b224-0993eba195f6",
                        "source_entry_id": "a014a1d0-5473-379d-8c96-358f7b128ba2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Franc",
                        "target_lang_word": "bluntly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bluntly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b7756ff-1470-312c-a0f3-69760e2496eb",
                                        "entry_id": "498d09ab-77c6-3f37-9bd7-80704a838c8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a blunt manner; without delicacy, or the usual forms of civility."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c948693-1f19-478c-84d3-c40f0ab41782",
                                                "sense_id": "9b7756ff-1470-312c-a0f3-69760e2496eb",
                                                "text": "Note the preſumption of this Scythian ſlaue:\nI tel thee villaine, thoſe that lead my horſe\nHaue to their names tytles of dignitie,\nAnd dar’ſt thou bluntly cal me Baiazeth?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e8f4e80-d6d8-4612-9df6-f4a278baded9",
                                                "sense_id": "9b7756ff-1470-312c-a0f3-69760e2496eb",
                                                "text": "To put it bluntly, they are going to have to start defending a heck of a lot better than they have been, otherwise their season - and top-flight status - could well be over before they know it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26f6ec1f-eaee-4e3b-8752-d5a5eca50a61",
                                                "sense_id": "9b7756ff-1470-312c-a0f3-69760e2496eb",
                                                "text": "Drivers' union ASLEF bluntly rebuffed the claim of unofficial action, calling it a lie. And Avanti West Coast was unable to provide any proof for its assertion, when questioned by RAIL."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28ab21aa-6f9f-4832-941e-7400c7861d1e",
                        "source_entry_id": "a014a1d0-5473-379d-8c96-358f7b128ba2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Franc",
                        "target_lang_word": "plainly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plainly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "843c51bd-e45e-3de7-9e81-17bf9394c3d0",
                                        "entry_id": "e4adbbf6-8f86-3187-a3cb-743b404b4697",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a plain manner; simply; basically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c94f750-8fa7-4427-a4de-e01b945d2d08",
                                                "sense_id": "843c51bd-e45e-3de7-9e81-17bf9394c3d0",
                                                "text": "She decorated the room plainly but neatly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2522760-5d67-4dff-821a-9551efd86e30",
                                                "sense_id": "843c51bd-e45e-3de7-9e81-17bf9394c3d0",
                                                "text": "'Tell me plainly what you think of my daughter's little companion.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0160e8cc-c48a-3fbf-a2d1-b00fc2c982cf",
                                        "entry_id": "e4adbbf6-8f86-3187-a3cb-743b404b4697",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obviously; clearly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1060563-3455-4aeb-8fec-0099957aa51f",
                                                "sense_id": "0160e8cc-c48a-3fbf-a2d1-b00fc2c982cf",
                                                "text": "You will see that ours is plainly the better method."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84af7e50-d76c-436e-9827-75c6f2d77b1c",
                                                "sense_id": "0160e8cc-c48a-3fbf-a2d1-b00fc2c982cf",
                                                "text": "The stories did not seem to me to touch life. They were plainly intended to have a bracing moral effect, and perhaps had this result for the people at whom they were aimed. They left me with the impression of a well-delivered stereopticon lecture, with characters about as life-like as the shadows on the screen, and whisking on and off, at the mercy of the operator."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "405ed914-8d92-40b0-97ec-1a9b888153fe",
                                                "sense_id": "0160e8cc-c48a-3fbf-a2d1-b00fc2c982cf",
                                                "text": "Plainly he was prepared to bark out an interminable succession of charges against the Wanderer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
